{"product_id":"vladdin-nic-salt-green-apple","title":"Vladdin Nic Salt - Green Apple","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGreen Apple:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Crisp, tangy, and irresistibly fresh, Green Apple delivers the quintessential taste of biting into a perfectly ripe Granny Smith. Each puff floods the palate with the tartness of green apples, while subtle undertones of sweetness linger on the exhale. It's a flavor that captures the essence of a crisp autumn day, offering a refreshing vaping experience that's both familiar and delightful.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 30mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vladdin-salts\" title=\"Vladdin nic salts\"\u003eVladdin\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ml Chubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vladdin","offers":[{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41774706622519,"sku":"Vladdin Green Apple 30 Mg","price":1490.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41774706655287,"sku":"Vladdin Green Apple 50 Mg","price":1490.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Vladdin-Green-Apple-Nic-Salt-30ml-min.jpg?v=1752484009","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vladdin-nic-salt-green-apple","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




